{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-03-30 20:21:00', 'title': 'ESAB SET TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400; PROG HOLDINGS TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ESAB CORP. (NYSE: ESAB) WILL BE ADDED TO THE S&P MIDCAP 400 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON TUESDAY, APRIL 5. EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON WEDNESDAY, APRIL 6, S&P MIDCAP 400 CONSTITUENT PROG HOLDINGS INC. (NYSE: PRG) WILL REPLACE FIESTA RESTAURANT GROUP INC. (NASD: FRGI) IN THE S&P SMALLCAP 600.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-03-30 19:48:00', 'title': 'BANNER BANK RANKED AMONG TOP 50 U.S. PUBLIC BANKS', 'text': "WALLA WALLA, WASH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #FORBESWORLDSBESTBANK--BANNER BANK HAS BEEN NAMED ONE OF THE TOP PERFORMING U.S. PUBLIC BANKS OF 2021 BY S&P GLOBAL MARKET INTELLIGENCE, A DIVISION OF S&P GLOBAL (NYSE: SPGI), THE WORLD'S FOREMOST PROVIDER OF CREDIT RATINGS, BENCHMARKS AND ANALYTICS IN THE GLOBAL CAPITAL AND COMMODITY MARKETS. THE NEW RANKING MEASURED THE FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE OF PUBLICLY-TRADED BANKS WITH MORE THAN $10 BILLION IN TOTAL ASSETS AT YEAR-END 2021. WHILE THIS IS THE FIRST YEAR FOR THIS CATEGOR"}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-03-30 10:00:00', 'title': 'S&P DOW JONES INDICES LAUNCHES INDEX TRACKING COMMODITIES USED IN ELECTRIC VEHICLE PRODUCTION', 'text': 'LONDON , MARCH 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P DOW JONES INDICES ("S&P DJI"), THE WORLD\'S LEADING INDEX PROVIDER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE S&P GSCI ELECTRIC VEHICLE METALS. THIS NEW FUTURES-BASED INDEX MEASURES THE PERFORMANCE OF TRADEABLE METALS USED IN THE PRODUCTION OF ELECTRIC VEHICLES AND WEIGHTS THEM ACCORDING TO THEIR RELATIVE USAGE IN A REPRESENTATIVE ELECTRIC VEHICLE.'}